JellyCon patch for Arctic Fuse 3 (made on skin version 3.4.13)

Loads the chapters (with the images extracted by the Jellyfin server) and the
cast of the playing item from JellyCon in the video OSD sections of the skin.
Other videos keep the original skin sections.

Apply (Kodi flatpak path, change it for other installs):
    patch -p1 -d ~/.var/app/tv.kodi.Kodi/data/addons/skin.arctic.fuse.3 < osd_jellycon.patch

Revert:
    patch -R -p1 -d ~/.var/app/tv.kodi.Kodi/data/addons/skin.arctic.fuse.3 < osd_jellycon.patch

A skin update overwrites the patched files, apply the patch again after it.

